5,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's start by establishing a clear method for our discussions. I believe we should focus on logical consistency and behavioral patterns to identify the werewolf. I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely. What are your strategies for this game?,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very thorough approach, Minako-san. As for me, I simply hope we can all be honest and kind to one another. Perhaps if we listen with open hearts, the truth will reveal itself.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Minako. Logical consistency is the only reliable metric here. I'll be observing how everyone's claims evolve over time; contradictions are usually the first sign of deception. Let's keep our observations objective.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur with the focus on logic. While kindness is a lovely sentiment, Shizue-san, I believe a polite but rigorous analysis of our statements will be our most effective tool in uncovering the wolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited to play! I think we should just be honest and help each other out. If we all trust each other, it'll be easier to spot someone acting weird, right? Let's just have fun with it!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"While trust is a good sentiment, Kenji, we must remember that the werewolf's goal is to deceive us. I suggest we prioritize evidence over intuition. Does anyone have a specific way they plan to track contradictions?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I don't have a formal method, dear, but I find that when people are anxious, their words sometimes drift. I will simply listen carefully to everyone and hope we can find the answer together peacefully.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be focusing on the timing and nature of the responses. When someone is lying, they often over-explain or hesitate when pressed for specifics. I'll be cross-referencing every claim made against the established facts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating approach, Mizuki-san. I shall complement that by monitoring the internal consistency of each person's narrative. A lie is often a fragile thing; it requires a perfect memory to maintain, which is where the cracks usually appear.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki @Benjamin You guys sound like detectives! It's a bit scary how much you're analyzing everything. I'll just be myself and trust my gut. If someone seems suspicious, I'll let you know!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have a divide between those relying on logic and those relying on intuition. While gut feelings can be useful, they are subjective. Let's agree to document any specific contradictions we find.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful compromise, Minako-san. It is always good to have a record of our thoughts. I will do my best to support you all in any way I can.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. Subjectivity can be a liability in this game. I'll be paying close attention to who tries to steer the conversation away from logical scrutiny, as that's often a defensive tactic used by the werewolf or the possessed.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the attempt to deflect or emotionalize the discussion is a classic tell. I shall remain mindful of such diversions, ensuring our path toward the truth remains unobstructed by unnecessary noise.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki @Benjamin You're making me feel like I'm under a microscope! Why are you guys so focused on ""deflecting""? I'm just trying to keep things positive so we don't all start fighting!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's not mistake positivity for a lack of vigilance, Kenji. We are all on the same team unless proven otherwise. For now, let's proceed with this balanced approach. I look forward to seeing the results tomorrow.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Minako-san. Let us all get some restful sleep tonight. I truly hope that tomorrow brings us clarity and that we can continue to treat each other with kindness.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be watching for any shifts in behavior once the first night's results are in. Let's see who remains calm and who begins to falter under the pressure of logic. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most productive introduction. I shall retire now to reflect on our baseline behaviors. I wish you all a peaceful night, though I suspect some of us may find it more restless than others. Good night.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I hope we can all get along tomorrow. I'm going to sleep now, but I'll be thinking about how to help us find the wolf! See you all in the morning!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
